Example firmware
----------------

The compiled example firmware (examples/*/firmware/*.hex, e.g.
examples/blink/firmware/blink.hex) is bundled into the web app. Besides the
example sketch (Apache-2.0), each image is statically linked with:

  Arduino AVR core (arduino:avr 1.8.8)  GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1,
                                        Copyright (c) the Arduino authors
  avr-libc                              BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) the
                                        avr-libc authors

The sketch sources sit next to each .hex, and the image can be rebuilt from
source, with the exact pinned toolchain, by following
examples/blink/firmware/BUILD.md (scripts/build-firmware.sh and
toolchains/arduino/Dockerfile). The Arduino AVR core sources are available
from https://github.com/arduino/ArduinoCore-avr (tag 1.8.8).

